  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Check whether this <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a> is equal to another <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "检查此<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Segment</code></a>是否等于另一个<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Segment</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Generate a hash code from this<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从该<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Segment</code></a>生成哈希码。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a SQL string representation of this <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回此<a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Segment</code></a>的 SQL 字符串表示形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Hashcode typically derives from the <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> representation so two <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a>s yield the same\n<a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode()</code></a> if their <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> representation matches.",
      "translation": "Hashcode 通常源自 <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> 表示形式，因此如果两个 <a href=\"Segment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Segment</code></a> 的 <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> 表示形式相同，则它们会产生相同的 <a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Equality is typically given if the <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> representation matches.",
      "translation": "通常，当<a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a>的表示形式匹配时，会给出相等性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The representation is intended for debugging purposes and an approximation to the generated SQL. While it might\nwork in the context of a specific dialect, you should not assume that the <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> representation works across\nmultiple databases.",
      "translation": "该表示形式旨在用于调试目的，并作为生成 SQL 的近似值。虽然它可能在特定方言的上下文中有效，但您不应假设<a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a>表示形式可在多个数据库之间通用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Supertype of all Abstract Syntax Tree (AST) segments. Segments are typically immutable and mutator methods return new\ninstances instead of changing the called instance.",
      "translation": "所有抽象语法树（AST）片段的超类型。片段通常是不可变的，mutator 方法会返回新实例而不是修改被调用的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#equals(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">equals</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a></code>",
      "translation": "`Object` 类中的 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#equals(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">equals</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
